MNEMONICS	      EXPLANATION
LXI H,8000	    Load the HL register pair with the address 8000H.
MOV B,M	        Move the content of the memory location pointed by the HL pair (M) into register B.
INX H	          Increment the HL register pair to point to the next memory location (8001H).
MOV A,M	        Move the content of the memory location pointed by the updated HL pair (8001H) into the accumulator (A).
CMP B          	Compare the contents of register B with the accumulator (A).
JC STORE	      Jump to the label STORE if the carry flag is set (A < B).
MOV A,B	        If the carry flag is not set (A >= B), load the content of register B into the accumulator.
STORE: STA 8010	    Store the content of the accumulator (A) into the memory location 8010H.
HLT	            Halt the execution of the program.
